    "extraction_notes": [
      "B230A-13-F is the SMA package member of the B230/A (B220/A through B240/A) Schottky family.",
      "The p. 2 electrical-characteristics heading states TA = +25 °C unless otherwise specified, and Note 6 states that a short-duration pulse test minimizes self-heating.",
      "The table also gives 20 mA maximum leakage at rated VR and TA = +100 °C; the singular reverse_current field retains the normal-temperature 0.5 mA maximum, consistent with the specified 25 °C extraction condition.",
      "The Fig. 1 B220-through-B240 forward points and the Fig. 6 surge points were digitized directly from the plotted traces at labeled current or cycle positions; no interpolated data points were added.",
      "VRRM, VRWM, and VR are operating ratings, not a paired reverse-breakdown test, so breakdown_voltage and breakdown_current are null."
    ],
